    <briefdescription>
<para>Fullscreen quad VBO — shared geometry for all shader passes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Owns a VBO with 4 vertices in a triangle strip covering [-1,1] NDC.</para>
<para>GL resource lifecycle: <ref refid="structshader_1_1_quad_1a2f7c8b0a3beaa4c91698aee32f093de6" kindref="member">create()</ref> allocates VBO on the GL thread (call from newOpenGLContextCreated). <ref refid="structshader_1_1_quad_1a23b41191d7a967586a196278862db086" kindref="member">destroy()</ref> releases it (call from openGLContextClosing).</para>
<para>Thread contract: ALL methods GL THREAD only. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
